---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Free Video Plan
ogTitle: "Your free story and content plan | Bryant Atelier"
description: "Get a free video plan from Bryant Atelier, a Byron Bay film and content studio: your story in one line, 3 short-form ideas for this month, what others in your industry do well, and what's holding your video back. Within 2 business days, no obligation."
ogImage: /assets/og/free-video-plan.jpg
---
<header class="page-head on-dark">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Free Video Plan</span>
    <h1>your free story and content plan. {% draft %}</h1>
    <p class="lede muted">Tell us about your business. We'll send back a plan made for you: the story worth telling, what to film this month, what others in your industry do well, and what's holding your video back. {% draft %}</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="#request">{{ site.ctaLabel }} <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#how">How it works</a>
    </div>
    <p class="hero__text">{% include "partials/text-alt.njk" %}</p>
    <p class="hero__proof">No obligation. Useful even if we never work together. 2-minute form, plan within 2 business days. {% draft %}</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section on-light" aria-labelledby="inside-h" style="padding-top: var(--space-xl)">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What's in it</span>
      <h2 id="inside-h">four things, made for you. {% draft %}</h2>
    </div>
    {% set planLink = false %}{% include "partials/plan.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-mist" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-h">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2 id="how-h">three simple steps. {% draft %}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cols cols--3">
      <article class="col">
        <span class="col__num">01</span>
        <h3>Send your details</h3>
        <p class="col__body">Two minutes. Your business, your Instagram or website, and what you're after. {% draft %}</p>
      </article>
      <article class="col">
        <span class="col__num">02</span>
        <h3>We do the homework</h3>
        <p class="col__body">We look at your business the way a customer would, find the story, and work out what to film. {% draft %}</p>
      </article>
      <article class="col">
        <span class="col__num">03</span>
        <h3>Your plan lands</h3>
        <p class="col__body">A 10-minute video walkthrough and a one-page plan within 2 business days. If you want to talk it through, we book a call. No hard sell. {% draft %}</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-light" aria-label="What clients say">
  <div class="container">
    <figure class="pull-quote">
      <blockquote>&ldquo;From the very first meeting you understood the creative direction, and the attention to detail was second to none. The outcome exceeded all expectations.&rdquo;</blockquote>
      <figcaption><strong>Nathan Tanner</strong>, Founder, Bytropic Nutrition</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-deep" id="request" aria-labelledby="request-h">
  <div class="container contact">
    <div class="contact__details">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Request your plan</span>
        <h2 id="request-h" style="margin-top: 1rem">tell us about your business.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="muted">Your plan lands within 2 business days. Prefer not to fill in a form? <a href="{{ site.smsHref }}">Text Joel on {{ site.phoneLocal }}</a> or <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">email us</a>. Already know what you want? <a href="/contact/">Book a call</a>. {% draft %}</p>
    </div>
    <div>{% include "partials/plan-form.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</section>
